      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the info. so on that second point about the transit zones—if the team has a long layover and they actually want to leave the airport to grab dinner or a hotel for a few hours, i assume they definitely need the full entry visa instead of just the transit one? i don't want anyone getting stopped at the gate for trying to exit the terminal without the right paperwork.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
